{"sectionId":"atomic/atom","items":[{"id":"atomic--atom-k001","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"원자번호 Z는 양성자 수, 질량수 A는 양성자와 중성자 수의 합이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k002","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"동위원소는 Z가 같고 A가 다르다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k003","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"평균 원자량은 동위원소 질량의 존재비 가중평균이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k004","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"전자기파 E=hν=hc/λ이고 광전효과에서 최대 운동에너지=hν−일함수이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k005","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"수소형 원자 에너지는 Eₙ=−13.6Z²/n² eV이며 전이 에너지 차가 광자의 에너지에 대응한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k006","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"이 식은 다전자 원자에 그대로 적용하지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k007","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"주양자수 n은 껍질, 방위양자수 l=0,…,n−1은 오비탈 종류, 자기양자수 mₗ=−l,…,+l은 공간 방향, 스핀양자수 mₛ=±1/2를 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k008","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"s,p,d,f 부껍질에는 각각 1,3,5,7개 오비탈이 있고 한 오비탈에 반대 스핀 전자 최대 2개가 들어간다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k009","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"Aufbau 원리, Pauli 배타 원리, Hund 규칙으로 전자배치를 구성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k010","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"Cr은 [Ar]3d⁵4s¹, Cu는 [Ar]3d¹⁰4s¹의 대표적 예외다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k011","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"전이금속 양이온 형성 시 일반적으로 ns 전자가 (n−1)d 전자보다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k012","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"먼저 제거된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k013","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"최대 껍질 전자 수 2n².","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k014","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"수소형 오비탈 전체 마디 n−1, 각마디 l, 방사마디 n−l−1.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k015","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"Fe²⁺: [Ar]3d⁶; Fe³⁺: [Ar]3d⁵.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k016","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"홀전자가 있는 종은 상자성, 모든 전자가 짝지어진 종은 반자성이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"atomic--atom-k017","sectionId":"atomic/atom","unitId":"atomic","subject":"chemistry","text":"10개이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}